# swe-airline-delay -- environment variables
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTHING IN THIS PIPELINE COSTS MONEY.
#   * BTS / TranStats ................ no key
#   * NASA OMNIWeb / CDAWeb (cdasws) . no key
#   * NOAA SWPC / NOAA NCEI .......... no key
# The only credentials below are for a FREE OpenSky Network account. They are
# OPTIONAL: without them the pipeline still runs, just under the (lower)
# anonymous rate limit. Copy this file to `.env` (gitignored) to use them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
OPENSKY_CLIENT_ID=
OPENSKY_CLIENT_SECRET=
